   6:source\asw/wav_parser.c **** * \brief WAV file header parser — emFile version with dynamic chunk search
   7:source\asw/wav_parser.c **** *
   8:source\asw/wav_parser.c **** * Handles WAV files that have extra chunks (LIST, INFO etc.) between
   9:source\asw/wav_parser.c **** * the fmt chunk and data chunk. Searches for 'data' chunk dynamically
  10:source\asw/wav_parser.c **** * instead of assuming it is always at byte 36.
  11:source\asw/wav_parser.c **** */
